{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"relabeled"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"G"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"graph"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"G"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"by"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"transform"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"G"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"G"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph","text":"Graph"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"graph","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The graph to copy."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"transform","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The new name of each vertex, called once per vertex in vertex order.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Return Value"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The renamed copy."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The vertices are the distinct names in ","type":"text"},{"code":"graph","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"’s vertex order, each at its first","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"occurrence. Each edge of ","type":"text"},{"code":"graph","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", in ","type":"text"},{"code":"edges","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" order, is inserted with its ends renamed in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its own orientation (","type":"text"},{"code":"endpointIndices(ofEdgeAt:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"): a simple target","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"code":"UndirectedAdjacencyList","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") keeps the first of any edges that coincide, and a pseudograph","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"keeps them all. Attached maps are not carried; a value moves over by its renamed vertex.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Complexity","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(n + m), with one hash per vertex here and the target’s insertions."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Precondition","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The graph has vertex indices."}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A copy of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"graph"},{"type":"text","text":" with every vertex "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"v"},{"type":"text","text":" renamed "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"transform(v)"},{"type":"text","text":". The map need not be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one-to-one: vertices with equal names merge into one vertex, which takes all their edges,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so an edge between two of them becomes a self-loop."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/graphoperations\/graphprotocols\/mutablegraph\/relabeled(_:by:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols07MutableA0P0A10OperationsE9relabeled_2byxqd___6VertexQzAGQyd__XEtAA0A0Rd__lFZ","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/GraphOperations\/Relabeling.swift#L95","fileName":"Relabeling.swift"},"extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","title":"relabeled(_:by:)","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"relabeled"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"G"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"G"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"by"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"G"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"}],"roleHeading":"Type Method","modules":[{"name":"GraphOperations","relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"]}]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/GraphOperations\/documentation\/GraphOperations\/GraphProtocols\/MutableGraph\/relabeled(_:by:)"},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GraphOperations\/documentation\/GraphOperations","doc:\/\/GraphOperations\/documentation\/GraphOperations\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/GraphOperations\/documentation\/GraphOperations\/GraphProtocols\/MutableGraph"]]},"schemaVersio